  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes:\n      - Enhanced Utf8Map with AddOrUpdate logic to support dynamic entry overwriting.\n      - Optimized FileCache with a \"Virtual-First\" hydration strategy for internal system defaults.\n      - Improved static content resilience: internal fallbacks (index/404) are now automatically provided if disk assets are missing.\n      - Refined FileSystemWatcher integration to enable seamless Hot-Reload via atomic cache updates.\n      - Hardened HttpServerProtocol with defensive directory checks to prevent path-related exceptions.\n      - Maintained Zero-Allocation integrity by reusing ByteString references during cache synchronization.",
